 help them with any questions they might have. I am constantly needed to solve personality issues and organizational problems. If I had the time, I would certainly be able to get all of the issues here straightened out. But for now I have to content myself with keeping the negative energies at bay and preventing the Winterbeasts from attacking. I know it's a bit selfish to name them after myself, but as I am the only one that can defeat them, it makes sense.'\nYou say, 'tasks'\nIndagatrix Winters says, 'Well, let's see. I could use some teeth for my jewelry. I'd really like to make some for my compatriots here. They all seem so stressed and I think pretty things could help them. Hrmm... I could also use help with the, er, pet that I mentioned. It's impossible to explain, but I could use some ancient bones to make meal and maybe some bile to help with digestion.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Bones to Dust'.\n\n---\n\n2. Defeat skeletons and take their bones. 0/8 Howling Stones\nKill skeleton mobs, found throughout the zone\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum 5 gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
