      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Overthere [RoS]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Scout Ellidia [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a rubble golem [npc=53260]\n- a wayward cliff golem [npc=53271]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Dangerous Fauna [quest=8839]\n- Enemy Clearance [quest=8850]\n- Mercenary of The Overthere [quest=8920]\n**Era:** | !Ring of Scale\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 2 00:12:43 2017\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** Dangerous Fauna [quest=8839] and Enemy Clearance [quest=8850] .\nSeek out Praetor Scout Ellidia in The Overthere just inside the outpost at +1537, +1110, +2.\nYou say, 'Hail, Praetor Scout Ellidia'\nPraetor Scout Ellidia says, 'Hello, Jeffro. I was hoping you would show up. As you probably know The Overthere is a dangerous place with the wildlife and those rogue golems, but especially with all those sarnak marching around out there. We could certainly use your assistance making the place safer for my scouts. I don't suppose you have the [time]?'\nYou say, 'time'\nPraetor Scout Ellidia says, 'Wonderful. Thank you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Golems Gone Wild'.\n\n---\n\n1. Kill 10 rogue golems. 0/10 (The Overthere)\n\n\n\nMost golems in OT should update this step (not a cliff golem). Kill 10 of them.\n\n---\n\nAchievements\nMercenary of The Overthere [quest=8920]\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Experience",
