      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Overthere [RoS]\n**Who:**\n- Hortulanus Cryolex [ _Mission and Raids_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Expedition\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Quivering Scion [item=132232]\n**Related Zones:**\n- The Overthere [RoS]: Fell Foliage (Group)\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Cactiikii [npc=53717]\n- a burgeoning succulent [npc=53718]\n- a moldy chest - Fell Foliage [npc=53794]\n- a monstrous succulent [npc=53716]\n- a sprouting succulent [npc=53795]\n**Related Quests:**\n- For My Information [quest=8852]\n- Testing the Waters [quest=8843]\n- What Makes a Scorpiki? [quest=8853]\n**Era:** | !Ring of Scale\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 2 00:33:14 2017\nModified: Sun Aug 24 08:46:17 2025 | | Pre Requisite Quests: Testing the Waters [quest=8843], For My Information [quest=8852] and What Makes a Scorpiki? [quest=8853].\nThis is a shared task.\nSeek out Hortulanus Cryolex in The Overthere in the outpost at /loc +1686, +2028, +2.\nYou say, 'Hail, Hortulanus Cryolex'\nHortulanus Cryolex says, 'There are many hidden treasures over here in the Overthere,' smiling seductively. She picks up a [plant], and it sways side to side, the plant's green maw snapping at the air.\nYou say, 'Is that plant one of your treasures?'\nHortulanus Cryolex says, 'Flora is often overlooked, yet it's amazing and often misunderstood! Plants take in sustenance from the sun and the soil and produce unusual [wonders]. I've had the luxury of studying many wondrous plants myself.'\nYou say, 'Tell me more of these wonders you speak of.'\nHortulanus Cryolex says, 'One subject in particular has been giving me trouble; I've given it sunshine and dirt, but it's given me nothing but heartache and hurt. I believe the plant has great promise, if only I can get it to grow! Now the previous iteration was no only promising but exceedingly dangerous,' She glances about furtively, lowering her voice. 'The [guards] have forbidden further experimentation near the outpost!'\nYou say, 'You need to void the guards?'\nHortulanus Cryolex says, 'Yes. My tenure will be, uh, revoked if there are any more mishaps here.... Y-You have no idea how much energy I've put into the succulent!' she blurts out. 'You know, they have a latent capacity to [grow] quite explosively.\nYou say, 'Could I help you grow this succulent?'\nHortulanus Cryolex nods, stroking her chin. 'Yes. I can tell that you're both able and eager to help. We will plant my latest experiment. If the seed takes, it will grow quickly and could be dangerous. You will want to bring reinforcements in case things go badly. Let me know when you're ready to go into the [field].'\nYou say, 'I'm ready to go into the field.'\nHortulanus Cryolex says, 'Good! I like your enthusiasm. One last question. Can you gather a [large] force or will we only need supplies for a [smaller] group?\nYou say, 'smaller'\nHortulanus Cryolex says, 'Just let me know when you're [ready].'\nYou say, 'ready'\n**The task locks here.**\nYou have entered The Overthere.\n\n---\n\n**Task Window Says:** It is clear that Hortulanus's experiment will not go well. Your job is to make sure the horrible mess does not get too far out of control.\nYou say, 'Hail, Hortulanus Cryolex'\nHortulanus Cryolex says, 'Take this [scion] and quickly find a suitable place to plant it: to the south-east, away from here. If it takes, it will be very dangerous. Or do you wish to [leave]?'\nYou say, 'Give me the scion'\nHortulanus gives you a clicky (Quivering Scion) that you use to plant.\nOnce you use the clicky you will see this green text on the screen.\nThe plant begins expanding in short, jerky movements.\nA tiny scream can be heard underfoot as the succulent takes to the fertile soil. It begins growing rapidly.\nRustling and snapping is heard as the unfolding of the succulent's growing flesh becomes audible.\n1\\. Defeat Catiikii!. 0/1 The Overthere\nKill a monstrous succulent. He cons blue to 110.\nOnce you kill a monstrous succulent. Catiikii and a burgeoning succulent spawn in the same place as the monstrous succulent.\nAdds will spawn once you attack Catiikii. If more than 4 adds are up at a time, Catiikii becomes invulnerable. Catiikii will continue to spawn the burgeoning succulents are certain intervals until it is dead.\nBe aware that Catiikii has Shield of Needles buff on it which procs Agonizing Needles if you melee it (Single Target, Unresistable: Decrease HP when cast by 5000, Lifetap from Weapon Damage, Decrease Double Attack by 50%, Decrease Accuracy by 100%).\nKill them.\nOnce Catiikii is dead you'll see the following emote.\nYou've put an end to Cryolex's failed experiment.\n2\\. Open the chest. 0/1 The Overthere\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!\n125 Bathezid Trade Gems\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Bathezid Trade Gem [item=131783]\n- Blackened August Warhammer [item=131659]\n- Doomed Drape of Drakis [item=131621]\n- Eclipsed Bloodflower Ornament [item=131664]\n- Fragment of Ethereal Steel [item=131665]\n- Gilded Lance of Empathy [item=131655]\n- Gnashed Mantle [item=131619]\n- Marquise Cut Ruby Ornament [item=131663]\n- Noble Sceptre [item=131642]\n- Shawl of the Scribe [item=131622]\n- The Companion's Dagger [item=131652]\n- Valewalker's Morning Star [item=131651]\n- Vampiric Mace [item=131649]",
