      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- The Overthere [RoS]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Noctis Trayer [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Related Zones:**\n- Howling Stones [RoS]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Arisen Bones [npc=53550]\n- Arisen Fenistra [npc=53765]\n- Arisen Mentor Sishallan [npc=53774]\n- General V`Deers, the Arisen [npc=53563]\n- Ghost of Rile Sathir [npc=53796]\n- Nureya Arisen [npc=53561]\n- Shandral Arisen [npc=53562]\n- The Arisen Admiral Tylix [npc=53553]\n- The Arisen Dragoon T`Vem [npc=53558]\n- The Arisen Dragoon T`Vex [npc=53557]\n- a spectre of the Arisen [npc=53542]\n- an Arisen ghost [npc=53554]\n- an Arisen marine [npc=53545]\n- an Arisen mentor [npc=53546]\n- an Arisen officer [npc=53547]\n- an arisen convert [npc=53544]\n- an arisen spectre [npc=53548]\n- an iron sentinel of the Arisen [npc=53549]\n**Related Quests:**\n- For My Information [quest=8852]\n- Partisan of The Howling Stones [quest=8926]\n- Testing the Waters [quest=8843]\n- The Dragons' Graveyard [quest=8849]\n- The Orb of Fire [quest=8898]\n- The Orb of Luclin [quest=8893]\n- What Makes a Scorpiki? [quest=8853]\n**Era:** | !Ring of Scale\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Fri Dec 1 22:09:04 2017\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** Testing the Waters [quest=8843], For My Information [quest=8852], What Makes a Scorpiki? [quest=8853], The Dragons' Graveyard, The Orb of Luclin [quest=8849], The Orb of Fire [quest=8898].\nPraetor Noctis Trayer is in The Overthere outpost at +1647, +1700, +7.\nPraetor Noctis Trayer says, 'Hello, Strumph. We were hoping things would be quiet out here. I was certainly hoping so when I volunteered for this post. But something is up, and I could use help from some good adventurers to learn [what it means].\nYou say, 'what it means'\nPraetor Noctis Trayer says, 'Well, from what I understand the place called Howling Stones has been relatively quiet for decades. Sure, it's creepy full of undead in there, but nothing much changes. Lately, however, I've been seeing what seem to be new recruits to this cult that calls itself '[The Arisen]'. They have been going into the ruins and I would love to know why. I could really use your [help].'\nYou say, 'help'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Arisen'.\n\n---\n\n1. Defeat the Arisen and look for clues on their remains. 0/10 (Howling Stones)\n\n\n\nKill arisen mobs. **(Does this update when killing any mob with arisen in their name?)**\n\n2. Speak to the ghost of Rile. 0/1 (Howling Stones)\n\n\n\nThis mob pops when you kill arisen mobs. Hail this mob as soon as you see it even if you haven't gotten 10 kills yet in the previous step.\n\n\n---\n\nAchievements:\nPartisan of The Howling Stones [quest=8926]\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExperience\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
